# Admin CSS

- Entry: `app/assets/stylesheets/brawo_cms/admin.css` imports layered partials under `admin/`.
- Use `--brawo-*` variables from `_variables.css` before new hard-coded colors.
- Scope UI under `.brawo-admin`; do not override Bootstrap globally outside that wrapper.
- Page builder styles belong in `_page_builder.css` only.
- Section header comments for major blocks; avoid long per-selector commentary.
